{"summary":"I've discovered the true happiness during this adventure.","description":"One Way is a creative point-and-click game developed by CottonGame. You need to find a blue sphere in each scene to power an elevator to travel upward.\n\nYou have to watch and think carefully, in order to solve various puzzles in the game.\n\nEvery time the elevator goes up, you will enter an entirely new world. The game features an unique art style that gives life to the characters - like an octopus, an elephant, a robot and a man-eating flower. And of course, there are many more interesting things, intriguing challenges for you to discover.","esrbNotes":"Fantasy Violence, Mild Blood, Use of Tobacco","pegiNotes":"Mild Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/mxHX3g1f_Ds?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2ryqr87fHbPQWVL_cXWpPtRb_q9UByscPh61746jIMVmLBk2ulZjb27HTHxtKwskSli51mzqE_JN1Pxdv34CAHo","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/k9G0pSEBgXRpQ0JSpTfOz49Pi_oukeaJOei1nuUO3gFZl4j8FtITrhS51t0YE3H-RGk1c9dNIOcwfX2piHcV","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/2NVvbCsde_FpNJFDE2gZE_-K9CqUg7Adbhn71_dYUVzk6ahqth_CPmADduVXmESx83fZQhpr6PcuPnVdyp1pbg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/akiowJPk0Vh693TxJyBXxmAtfZ6KqsCuWvq4yXC2m4eC9J-PIwNngWdFdU2MSuCtqIxjyLxbV6WnZDT5Q7issrc","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/HhbKCeKgNkRLsQqLDQqu4BAAWXZBAWcUGSMuR4XGkqSen52Snc29NK7quZ-vHOCNT5BcqAfHIYOOQBIbhNhfog","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cjIpilrwLLMsz9la3XxzHIyFY02lGyFbEISdfgnz_fTOBF7QiCHztDQ4qFqgyBcDdY3ae2jHe_t_vCGZpoPk2Q","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/yPzwNKNhmAvNFogVCYyRJfvxpzpzNcDCMha9463F1kDJr3IJIlrS4FQhMVyYb2giD3gNGCMbP9KUtEBxjddp","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/M8Wb9-P-8X3X32n3GpPzoqAwVtd6PiJ1o-UrUS_fVTvwxLlB3o6vuFui8Pp4anUi73E4ixemG9Q7qwS8pk6pnQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/CxgRZlejYgVjaMl_IU2qiDs1BuNiZvmQbAN-BZYkUUDSQDGL2EoKoVYhhFzZZOnNqrjUuZtlCQkvLlIsR90gVw","http